# POLLY, Notes with a groove's instrument (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-12-note-editor-design.md): SEQ on Band, SEQ
# again. The style's Groove A (Pop): BA's first note selected, its pitch changed (the groove yours first: copy-on-write);
# D1's hits, a chord of drums at one place one by one, a hit's sound named and changed; a snare entered at an empty
# place, deleted, undone; zoomed. Stopped throughout.
wait 300
tap SEQ
expect page 6
turn ALGO -1
expect track 4
tap SEQ
expect page 17
expect ne_t 0
expect tag_is_S1>Pop>Groove_A>BA_Finger_Bass 1
expect slot1_trk4_note0 36
expect ne_note 36
expect notes_where_is_BA|bar_1.1|C2 1
wait 300
shot band_bass.png
# ---- its pitch up a tone: Groove A (yours) first
spin K2 2
expect ne_note 38
expect slot1_trk4_note0 38
# (the question below takes the header from GROOVE A NOW YOURS; the tag says yours)
expect tag_is_S1>Pop>Groove_A_(yours)>BA_Finger_Bass 1
wait 300
shot band_bass_edit.png
# (a downbeat the Bass rule plays as the root: asked once whether to play it as written; no here, bass_rule.polly)
expect asking 1
tap HOME
expect asking 0
# ---- D1: kick and closed hat at bar 1.1, one by one (by pitch); the hat a pedal hat (named)
turn ALGO -3
expect track 1
expect ne_t 0
expect ne_note 36
expect notes_where_is_D1|bar_1.1|Kick 1
turn SELECT 1
expect ne_note 42
expect ne_at 0
expect notes_where_is_D1|bar_1.1|Closed_hat 1
spin K2 2
expect slot1_trk1_note1 44
expect notes_where_is_D1|bar_1.1|Pedal_hat 1
wait 300
shot band_drum.png
# ---- a snare entered at the empty 16th after it (the keys two octaves down: key 9 is D1, 38), the cursor on after it
spin K1 1
expect ne_t 120
expect ne_note -1
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
tapkey 9
expect slot1_trk1_count 33
expect ne_t 240
turn SELECT -1
expect ne_note 38
expect ne_at 120
expect notes_where_is_D1|bar_1.1|Snare 1
wait 300
shot band_enter.png
# ---- deleted (EDIT), undone (HOME + REC)
tap EDIT
expect slot1_trk1_count 32
expect page 17
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect slot1_trk1_count 33
expect msg_is_UNDO 1
# ---- zoomed to a beat (PRESETS), back to 2 bars
turn PRESET 2
wait 300
shot band_zoom.png
turn PRESET -2
# ---- the cards: SEQ, EDIT held on Notes (let go: nothing)
press SEQ
wait 1100
expect card 10
shot card_notes.png
release SEQ
expect page 17
press EDIT
wait 1100
expect card 5
shot card_delete.png
release EDIT
expect page 17
expect slot1_trk1_count 33
# ---- SEQ again: Band
tap SEQ
expect page 6
